    <string name="privacy_sub">Cotes collects nothing</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Cotes has no internet access, no accounts, no ads and no analytics. Your notes are stored only in the app’s private storage on this device and are not included in cloud or device-to-device backups. They leave the phone only when you share a note or save a backup file yourself.</string>
